d the failures. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, which left the service mixed across regions. I retried the same rollback, and it completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 for checkout-api. The create call timed out, but the incident was already recorded, so I did not open a duplicate. Its summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry.\n\nFollow-ups for the team:\n- Find out why v2.3.1 failed health checks.\n- Look into the orchestrator halt, since it left the rollout partial.\n- Any redeploy of v2.3.1 needs change-manager approval, because it has never been healthy in production.", "type": "text"}]}]}